WEBVTT

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.536
I wasn't able to breathe well,

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.666
and I was rushed to the hospital

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:05.246
and almost immediately
put on life support.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:07.636
AG: Felicia slipped into a coma.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:11.296
Days passed, then a week, then two.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:14.446
When Felicia woke up,
she was completely disoriented.

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:16.566
FS: My first thought was "Where am I?

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:17.986
I thought I just had the flu.

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.046
Why are my hands and feet bandaged?

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.996
And when can I get back to work?"

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.211
I needed to be able
to support not only myself,

00:18:24.235 --> 00:18:25.424
but my family.

00:18:25.448 --> 00:18:28.106
AG: Felicia had contracted
a severe strain of pneumonia,

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.196
which poisoned her bloodstream.